u try again or remove stale locks. If two remote branches differ only in letter case, which macOS cannot store side by side, GitLama can repair this computer's copies and fetch again. If a push is rejected because the remote has newer commits, GitLama offers to fetch them. Remote hosts receive an updated helper.","The Fetch dialog has an option to keep remote branches that were deleted on the server."],"tag":"v0.1.0-beta.50-51","version":"0.1.0-beta.50"},{"assets":[{"architecture":"x86_64","bytes":30517752,"file":"GitLama-0.1.0-beta.49-50-linux-x86_64.AppImage","format":"AppImage","minimum_system":"glibc 2.35 and Git 2.39","platform":"linux","sha256":"7a242f0b992807924cdb0b9b38cdccec8370214041879b521d39d3aef323d0fe","url":"https://github.com/devmil/gitlama/releases/download/v0.1.0-beta.49-50/GitLama-0.1.0-beta.49-50-linux-x86_64.AppImage"},{"architecture":"x86_64","bytes":31956336,"file":"GitLama-0.1.0-beta.49-50-linux-x86_64.tar.gz","format":"tar.gz","minimum_system":"glibc 2.35 and Git 2.39","platform":"linux","sha256":"61f8c29c749f2a72d7c315c6a4b6766eb78cc7eb31552e86c0c977be92cf0f08","url":"https://github.com/devmil/gitlama/releases/download/v0.1.0-beta.49-50/GitLama-0.1.0-beta.49-50-linux-x86_64.tar.gz"},{"architecture":"arm64","bytes":34031944,"file":"GitLama-0.1.0-beta.49-50-macos-arm64.dmg","format":"dmg","minimum_system":"macOS 13.0 and Git 2.39","platform":"macos","sha256":"c287254a378ee0c23024f031be150f6267e166b40708de4d5b1f5657a50e99bb","update_signature":"OcNW3kjQvxO9kAvQs7LQTE83OL4d80IA76KAdqFhvoFzv+0ylubs+dcO+wMsAO3nLDqLqRbTryZDAi6c1Q9bBg==","url":"https://github.com/devmil/gitlama/releases/download/v0.1.0-beta.49-50/GitLama-0.1.0-beta.49-50-macos-arm64.dmg"},{"architecture":"x86_64","bytes":27672576,"file":"GitLama-0.1.0-beta.49-50-windows-x86_64.msi","format":"msi","minimum_system":"Windows 10 version 1809 and Git 2.39","platform":"windows","sha256":"b58333a421dc4f63aea290b6138d6ce8e2cfdb9042981f7e81ad424ccc1fa6fd","url":"https://github.com/devmil/gi